	(text "KAMERA PORTU BESLEMELERI (TPS26630, akim siniri 18 / 12k = 1,5 A): port basina 12 V, islemci acar. IMON 68k (1,5 A -> 2,8 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 230 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "06c9e7a1-8615-54fb-8582-19fe2aed21d9")
	)
	(text "+3V3_JET: Ethernet denetleyicileri, 1,8 V regulatoru. +3V3_M2: yalnizca NVMe. Cikis = 0,8 V x (1 + 316k / 100k) = 3,33 V, 3 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 420 34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0db2b4d6-9c54-5c91-95db-bc93c91e902b")
	)
	(text "TASIYICI BESLEMELERI: modul SYS_RESET*'i biraktiginda (1,8 V) acilir; ondan once kart Jetson uclarina gerilim vermez (uretici kurali)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 420 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4be96ce6-0fb0-540c-9b71-f8269714d50b")
	)
	(text "UVLO / OVP boluculeri uc sigortada ortak: 9,6 V altinda ve 15,3 V ustunde cikislar kapanir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "59460681-e8ee-55e7-be71-0d4ce81dfef5")
	)
	(text "+1V8_JET (LP5907-1.8): IMU ve seviye ceviricinin Jetson tarafi. Jetson'in giris-cikislari 1,8 V'tur."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 420 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "830c15f1-6327-5b6c-ad3b-4d69fe03e34c")
	)
	(text "eski (yalniz 5 V) modul takiliysa JET_VIN_EN verilmez. IMON = akim x 27,9 uA/A x 27k (4 A -> 3,0 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 126 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9010fabd-aea9-5cc6-94b3-e98eb4193365")
	)
	(text "JETSON BESLEMESI (TPS26630, akim siniri 18 / 4k53 = 4 A): modul 5-20 V kabul eder, 12 V dogrudan verilir. Islemci once MODULE_ID'yi okur;"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 120 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cdad39a3-3297-5693-a85a-0a31382e9c11")
	)
	(text "GIRIS: omurga 12 V'u ters baglanti korumasindan (P kanal MOSFET) gecer. Bu kart 3-4 A cektigi icin dugumun 3 A'lik diyodu kullanilmaz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e3c947ac-1db4-5781-be50-82deaa3436ef")
	)
